WEBVTT

01:50.039 --> 01:53.940
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.300 --> 01:56.860
[Episode 25]

02:00.070 --> 02:02.300
Ms. Xiao, I need to go now.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.280
Mr. Xiao, I'm here to get my laptop.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.680
Sorry for the intrusion.

02:06.640 --> 02:08.590
I haven't formally introduced you
to each other yet.

02:08.590 --> 02:11.050
I've already introduced myself
to Ms. Xiao.

02:15.240 --> 02:17.170
Let me make a proper introduction.

02:17.430 --> 02:18.190
This is my mother,

02:18.190 --> 02:18.920
Xiao Wanyue.

02:21.640 --> 02:22.210
Mom.

02:23.480 --> 02:24.550
This is Hu Xiu,

02:27.910 --> 02:28.870
the woman I love.

02:54.150 --> 02:54.780
Mom.

02:55.190 --> 02:56.310
This is Hu Xiu,

02:57.200 --> 02:58.200
the woman I love.

03:05.030 --> 03:06.960
He definitely did that on purpose.

03:34.550 --> 03:35.200
Mom.

03:36.240 --> 03:38.240
What brings you here all of a sudden?

03:38.750 --> 03:40.100
I was worried about you.

03:40.420 --> 03:41.860
I saw that statement.

03:42.200 --> 03:44.000
You shouldn't have admitted it.

03:44.400 --> 03:45.430
By doing this,

03:45.630 --> 03:47.190
you've left yourself no room to maneuver.

03:47.190 --> 03:48.900
People will gossip about you.

03:50.360 --> 03:51.800
I am Qin Yuze's son.

03:52.150 --> 03:53.970
I don't feel ashamed to admit it.

03:54.030 --> 03:55.030
It's just a fact.

03:57.000 --> 03:59.120
I'm just worried that dredging up the past

03:59.120 --> 04:00.590
might upset you.

04:07.470 --> 04:08.520
It does.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.520
I lost someone very important to me.

04:15.210 --> 04:17.209
Was it because of that girl just now?

04:18.649 --> 04:20.050
Did she turn you down

04:20.120 --> 04:22.180
because of your father's situation?

04:22.350 --> 04:24.620
How about I go explain things to her?

04:30.480 --> 04:32.070
The only way to get her back

04:33.920 --> 04:36.120
is to end all of this as soon as possible.

04:42.110 --> 04:42.640
Mom.

04:44.700 --> 04:46.750
Have you ever been involved in
Forma's operations,

04:46.750 --> 04:47.620
even just as a figurehead

04:47.620 --> 04:49.680
or through financial transactions?

04:51.159 --> 04:52.720
Why do you ask?

04:56.000 --> 04:57.230
No particular reason—

04:57.230 --> 04:58.040
just asking.

05:07.720 --> 05:08.530
Hello, Mr. Xiao.

05:08.530 --> 05:09.530
How can I help you?

05:10.310 --> 05:11.480
I'd like to arrange

05:11.480 --> 05:13.000
a premium annuity insurance plan
for my family—

05:13.000 --> 05:15.630
one with high cash value,
and it has to be irrevocable.

05:15.630 --> 05:16.430
No problem.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.630
We'll just need you to

05:17.630 --> 05:19.630
provide the client's information,

05:19.690 --> 05:22.020
bank account details and proof of assets.

05:22.140 --> 05:22.700
Okay.

05:58.310 --> 05:58.870
Why...

06:00.150 --> 06:01.220
Why is it you?

06:01.800 --> 06:02.600
Mr. Huang,

06:03.050 --> 06:04.650
you seem surprised to see me.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.360
Mr. Xu here told me

06:08.360 --> 06:10.000
someone wanted to discuss business
with me.

06:10.000 --> 06:11.130
I just didn't expect

06:11.430 --> 06:12.480
it would be you.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.310
You know me?

06:16.870 --> 06:18.360
Mr. Xiao from D Studio.

06:18.360 --> 06:20.160
Who in this industry doesn't know you?

06:20.160 --> 06:21.430
But strangely,

06:21.510 --> 06:22.160
I

06:22.160 --> 06:23.270
have never had any dealings

06:23.270 --> 06:24.160
with your studio whatsoever,

06:24.160 --> 06:25.920
so how did you end up coming to me?

06:25.920 --> 06:28.120
We actually had a chance to work together.

06:28.120 --> 06:29.050
Unfortunately,

06:29.390 --> 06:30.390
your company's name

06:30.390 --> 06:31.360
didn't appear on

06:31.360 --> 06:33.920
the supplier list provided by Forma.

06:34.750 --> 06:35.550
That's right.

06:35.830 --> 06:38.000
I stopped working with Forma
a long time ago.

06:38.000 --> 06:38.720
So there isn't really

06:38.720 --> 06:40.600
any business for us to discuss, either.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.720
How about this? You two carry on.

06:41.720 --> 06:42.780
I'll take my leave.

06:46.800 --> 06:47.830
You can leave,

06:48.510 --> 06:49.190
but

06:49.690 --> 06:51.350
I won't help you a second time.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.159
After all, it's not just loan sharks

06:54.159 --> 06:55.720
who are after you out there.

07:08.720 --> 07:09.630
I recognize this car.

07:09.630 --> 07:11.430
It belongs to Pei Kanghua's men.

07:13.160 --> 07:13.950
I didn't expect them

07:13.950 --> 07:15.190
to track me down there.

07:15.190 --> 07:16.190
But

07:16.540 --> 07:18.100
you weren't their target.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.750
I really shouldn't have

07:26.860 --> 07:28.770
told him I had those things.

07:29.870 --> 07:30.720
What things?

07:33.720 --> 07:34.480
Nothing.

07:35.240 --> 07:37.120
It's just you really shouldn't

07:37.310 --> 07:38.800
borrow money casually.

07:39.190 --> 07:39.950
If you can't pay it back,

07:39.950 --> 07:41.680
they hunt you down everywhere.

07:41.720 --> 07:42.600
It's such a pain.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.240
So annoying.

07:43.240 --> 07:44.240
That makes sense.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.600
They can't even plug their own holes.

07:46.600 --> 07:48.659
Why would they spare any money on you?

07:49.680 --> 07:51.270
What do you mean by that, Mr. Xiao?

07:51.270 --> 07:52.360
I mean

07:52.720 --> 07:55.430
Pei Kanghua is like a cornered beast
putting up a desperate fight.

07:55.430 --> 07:57.360
He's already running out of steam.

07:58.040 --> 08:00.160
How could that be?

08:00.720 --> 08:01.600
Because

08:02.830 --> 08:04.390
I'll make sure Pei Kanghua

08:04.390 --> 08:05.800
is completely ruined.

08:07.480 --> 08:07.950
You...

08:08.180 --> 08:10.210
Mr. Huang, you know this already.

08:12.120 --> 08:13.720
I'm not just Xiao Zhiyu—

08:15.630 --> 08:17.680
I'm also Qin Yuze's son.

08:19.550 --> 08:21.560
Mr. Huang, what you probably don't know

08:21.560 --> 08:22.760
is that I already met you in America

08:22.760 --> 08:24.200
20 years ago.

08:24.390 --> 08:25.560
Twenty years ago?

08:26.000 --> 08:27.580
You were very decisive and bold back then,

08:27.580 --> 08:28.700
Mr. Huang,

08:29.310 --> 08:32.169
going all the way to America
to confront Pei Kanghua

08:32.429 --> 08:35.960
and securing a path to wealth for yourself
with just a few words.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.870
The price, however,

08:38.630 --> 08:40.750
was my father's life.

08:42.000 --> 08:42.630
No, no, no.

08:43.200 --> 08:43.840
Mr. Xiao.

08:44.120 --> 08:44.960
I swear

08:45.150 --> 08:45.720
I

08:46.120 --> 08:47.720
have nothing to do
with your father's death.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.120
It was all Pei Kanghua...

08:54.360 --> 08:55.980
I'm not here to bring charges against you.

08:55.980 --> 08:58.100
I came today to make a deal.

09:00.030 --> 09:01.390
And why do you think

09:01.790 --> 09:03.390
I'd do a deal with you?

09:03.720 --> 09:06.780
Because I have all the time in the world
to wear you down.

09:06.960 --> 09:09.590
If I can get Forma placed
under financial investigation today,

09:09.590 --> 09:12.650
I can just as easily leave you
with no way back tomorrow.

09:13.150 --> 09:14.000
Tell me—

09:14.440 --> 09:16.880
if Pei Kanghua finds out
I've tracked you down,

09:16.880 --> 09:18.040
given his nature,

09:18.070 --> 09:20.530
do you think he'll trust you
as he always has,

09:22.120 --> 09:24.550
or eliminate you without hesitation?

09:31.410 --> 09:32.680
Don't be so nervous.

09:36.290 --> 09:37.250
Tell me—

09:39.280 --> 09:41.280
what is the evidence

09:42.370 --> 09:43.770
that you've hidden away?

09:51.440 --> 09:53.570
Luckily, Huang Yide was shrewd enough

09:54.060 --> 09:56.190
to photograph the evidence back then.

09:57.200 --> 09:57.840
It's just

09:57.960 --> 09:59.270
he's still wary of us,

09:59.510 --> 10:02.170
refusing to reveal
where he hid the memory card.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.240
Should we

10:04.480 --> 10:05.390
think of a way

10:05.600 --> 10:06.530
to make him talk?

10:09.840 --> 10:12.240
Being too aggressive would only backfire.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.050
This place is quite secluded.

10:16.070 --> 10:17.870
Let him stay in that room for now.

10:18.150 --> 10:20.950
He won't dare go out casually
anytime soon anyway.

10:21.360 --> 10:21.960
Uncle Xu.

10:22.690 --> 10:24.490
Come with me to a place tomorrow.

10:24.870 --> 10:25.550
Where to?

10:37.790 --> 10:39.200
Huang Yide?

11:15.000 --> 11:17.360
Is this why he wanted me to move in here?

11:32.360 --> 11:33.260
[Pei Kanghua]

11:33.280 --> 11:34.190
[Qin Yuze]

11:34.220 --> 11:35.230
[Acceptance of accident liability
(quick settlement)]

11:39.450 --> 11:40.020
[Huang Yide]

11:40.600 --> 11:41.870
Huang Yide...

11:56.980 --> 11:59.600
This set of supplier information
is incomplete.

11:59.600 --> 12:02.070
I need the full list of Forma's
partner manufacturers.

12:02.070 --> 12:03.190
It's like

12:03.240 --> 12:04.390
he never really planned to

12:04.390 --> 12:06.320
work with Forma in the first place.

12:06.510 --> 12:08.040
His cooperation with Forma

12:08.270 --> 12:10.800
was only to narrow down
and find this factory.

12:11.910 --> 12:14.040
What's so special about this factory?

12:21.170 --> 12:23.400
[Advance Notice of Administrative Penalty]

12:21.170 --> 12:23.400
[Shanghai Municipal
Environmental Protection Bureau]

12:24.510 --> 12:25.390
You think

12:25.630 --> 12:27.390
this is where Huang Yide

12:27.630 --> 12:28.760
hid the memory card?

12:31.030 --> 12:32.110
Huang Yide didn't seem surprised

12:32.110 --> 12:34.710
that Pei Kanghua was looking for him
everywhere.

12:34.710 --> 12:36.180
But yesterday, when he learned

12:36.180 --> 12:37.330
that someone had discovered this place,

12:37.330 --> 12:39.260
he seemed particularly panicked.

12:41.150 --> 12:43.750
He's been dodging his debts
and hasn't even dared go home,

12:43.750 --> 12:45.480
yet he came to the factory once.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.890
There must be a reason.

12:51.720 --> 12:53.200
This place is huge.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.320
Where could he have hidden it?

12:55.790 --> 12:58.250
It's like looking for a needle
in a haystack.

13:00.520 --> 13:02.030
Let's split up and look around.

13:02.030 --> 13:02.630
Okay.

13:20.010 --> 13:20.740
Who's there?

13:43.260 --> 13:44.210
Why are you here?

13:47.590 --> 13:48.920
I could ask you the same.

13:52.870 --> 13:53.510
Hu Xiu.

13:53.630 --> 13:54.890
I know everything now.

13:55.630 --> 13:57.370
You're investigating Huang Yide,

13:57.370 --> 13:58.890
this factory,

14:00.120 --> 14:01.480
and Pei Kanghua as well.

14:04.120 --> 14:06.840
Pei Kanghua had worked with Huang Yide
for so many years,

14:06.840 --> 14:07.840
yet when you asked for
the supplier information,

14:07.840 --> 14:09.480
they hastily terminated their contract.

14:09.480 --> 14:13.340
It was because Pei Kanghua was worried
you'd investigate him, right?

14:14.960 --> 14:17.020
Are they connected to that accident—

14:17.550 --> 14:19.350
to what happened to your father?

14:24.630 --> 14:27.090
Whatever it is,
it has nothing to do with you.

14:28.550 --> 14:31.610
If what you're investigating is
that accident from back then,

14:31.610 --> 14:33.140
then it involves my father,

14:33.200 --> 14:34.440
which means it involves me too.

14:34.440 --> 14:35.750
I have the right to know.

14:35.750 --> 14:36.910
So you took matters into your own hands

14:36.910 --> 14:38.550
and came here all by yourself?

14:38.550 --> 14:40.320
Do you know Huang Yide is in trouble?

14:40.320 --> 14:42.120
What if the person you ran into today
wasn't me,

14:42.120 --> 14:43.080
but a debt collector

14:43.080 --> 14:44.150
or someone working for Pei Kanghua?

14:44.150 --> 14:45.150
What then?

14:47.120 --> 14:48.790
But the person I ran into was you,

14:48.790 --> 14:49.670
Xiao Zhiyu!

14:51.450 --> 14:53.150
I'm standing right here in front of you,

14:53.150 --> 14:54.390
and I've asked you so many questions,

14:54.390 --> 14:56.450
but you haven't answered any of them!

15:07.150 --> 15:07.960
Hu Xiu.

15:09.390 --> 15:11.720
I don't have any answers
for you right now.

15:13.550 --> 15:14.830
But the way you're acting right now—

15:14.830 --> 15:17.230
you're just making things harder for me...

15:49.430 --> 15:50.560
I'll drive you home.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.430
This place is remote.

15:52.430 --> 15:54.290
I can't let you leave by yourself.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.480
I'll get a taxi.

15:56.480 --> 15:57.680
Save you the trouble.

16:00.320 --> 16:02.360
Since you refuse to tell me anything,

16:02.360 --> 16:03.390
then why are you grabbing me?

16:03.390 --> 16:04.030
Let go.

16:05.320 --> 16:06.080
Let go of me.

16:08.150 --> 16:09.000
I won't.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.600
On what grounds?

16:11.790 --> 16:12.910
You've kept so many secrets from me.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.770
Why are you acting all torn up now?

16:14.960 --> 16:15.510
I only kept things from you

16:15.510 --> 16:16.750
because I didn't want to
drag you into this.

16:16.750 --> 16:17.870
If anything were to happen...

16:17.870 --> 16:19.080
You always have so many excuses.

16:19.080 --> 16:21.880
So I'm just supposed to
accept everything, right?

16:22.910 --> 16:23.720
Xiao Zhiyu.

16:24.550 --> 16:27.010
Do you know
what the most ridiculous part is?

16:27.390 --> 16:28.550
Right here.

16:29.150 --> 16:31.080
This place is filled with
secrets and hatred.

16:31.080 --> 16:32.600
And yet you lied to me, telling me

16:32.600 --> 16:34.200
that what was in there was me.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.080
No, please...

16:38.260 --> 16:39.060
You think

16:39.750 --> 16:41.010
you're protecting me?

16:41.150 --> 16:42.030
No.

16:42.870 --> 16:45.000
This is the cruelest kind of betrayal.

16:45.150 --> 16:47.320
You're making me feel like
a complete fool.

16:47.320 --> 16:47.870
I

16:48.120 --> 16:50.030
thought there were no secrets between us.

16:50.030 --> 16:50.830
But in the end,

16:50.880 --> 16:52.910
I don't even know who the one
I'm in love with is

16:52.910 --> 16:54.860
or what he's really trying to do.

16:54.880 --> 16:55.600
I...

17:03.790 --> 17:04.640
Xiao Zhiyu.

17:05.160 --> 17:08.109
As far as you and I are concerned,
I can say I have a clear conscience.

17:08.109 --> 17:08.829
But you—

17:10.270 --> 17:12.200
no matter how you say you like me,

17:12.200 --> 17:13.640
you still make me feel like

17:13.640 --> 17:15.880
I'm only getting your castoffs.

17:18.510 --> 17:21.680
♪ It's true ♪

17:22.069 --> 17:25.339
♪ I miss you ♪

17:25.420 --> 17:31.660
♪ Hope the night brings me to you ♪

17:33.150 --> 17:35.790
♪ And I also know ♪

17:36.280 --> 17:42.630
♪ The night will pass
and I have to part with you ♪

17:43.000 --> 17:44.110
That's not true.

17:43.250 --> 17:51.420
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

17:44.920 --> 17:45.680
Don't think of me that way.

17:45.680 --> 17:47.160
Prove it to me then.

17:49.000 --> 17:50.920
Either tell me everything,

17:50.920 --> 17:51.640
or

17:53.000 --> 17:54.110
let me go.

17:53.370 --> 17:59.440
♪ Hope the dream brings me to you ♪

18:01.140 --> 18:03.100
♪ And I also know ♪

18:03.120 --> 18:09.640
♪ The dreams are false
and I should forget you ♪

18:11.260 --> 18:21.260
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

18:12.510 --> 18:13.750
I've already told you

18:15.110 --> 18:16.710
everything you want to know.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.310
Is what you're doing now

18:28.880 --> 18:30.310
dangerous?

18:43.080 --> 18:44.190
Do you remember

18:44.400 --> 18:45.510
what you said to me

18:46.000 --> 18:47.400
during Spring Festival?

18:49.590 --> 18:50.450
What about you?

18:51.160 --> 18:54.620
Is there anything you're determined
to accomplish this year?

18:55.310 --> 18:56.200
I want to

18:59.270 --> 19:00.480
find that answer.

19:09.590 --> 19:11.160
Don't torment yourself.

19:12.030 --> 19:14.030
I believe you'll find it.

19:17.860 --> 19:19.300
I'll definitely find it.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.480
No wonder

19:53.520 --> 19:55.720
he's held on so tightly to Qin Xiaoyi,

19:56.930 --> 19:58.520
and to his father.

20:10.750 --> 20:12.100
Will you be home tomorrow?

20:12.100 --> 20:14.900
Gong Huaicong and I are planning to
come visit you.

20:24.920 --> 20:25.720
So,

20:25.800 --> 20:27.160
isn't this place nice?

20:27.720 --> 20:29.680
We found this place when we were
checking out cafés a couple of days ago.

20:29.680 --> 20:31.880
We figured we'd bring you here to relax.

20:33.270 --> 20:35.600
You two went checking cafés out together?

20:35.910 --> 20:36.390
Yes.

20:36.440 --> 20:37.240
That's right.

20:37.540 --> 20:39.590
Ms. Zhao and I just clicked.

20:39.880 --> 20:41.750
We both want to open a new place

20:41.790 --> 20:43.400
and keep the partnership going.

20:43.400 --> 20:45.730
Might as well make money together, right?

20:47.400 --> 20:49.480
So you two are business buddies now.

20:55.400 --> 20:57.270
Uncle Hu has recovered,

20:57.510 --> 20:59.240
so what's with the gloomy face?

20:59.300 --> 21:00.280
Have something sweet.

21:00.280 --> 21:02.270
Try this, it's their specialty.
It's really good.

21:02.270 --> 21:02.850
Come on.

21:06.290 --> 21:06.890
By the way,

21:07.160 --> 21:08.510
once you're both free
in the next couple of days,

21:08.510 --> 21:10.430
my club's new instance dungeon
should be ready.

21:10.430 --> 21:12.030
Come join the internal playtest.

21:12.030 --> 21:13.550
Think of it as a way to relax,

21:13.550 --> 21:15.400
and you can give me some feedback
while you're at it.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.730
A new instance dungeon?

21:16.920 --> 21:17.720
That's right.

21:18.240 --> 21:21.200
The story of Rongcheng
needs some new changes.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.030
I'll be going on a business trip
in a few days.

21:24.030 --> 21:26.560
I'll start working on it as soon as
I come back.

21:26.790 --> 21:27.400
So,

21:27.580 --> 21:29.580
will the characters change as well?

21:30.510 --> 21:31.440
I didn't want to change them

21:31.440 --> 21:32.470
at first,

21:32.720 --> 21:33.790
but Xiao told me

21:33.790 --> 21:35.750
he didn't want to play Qin Xiaoyi anymore.

21:35.750 --> 21:37.550
With the key character gone,

21:37.750 --> 21:39.680
there's no point keeping the rest.

21:47.360 --> 21:49.490
You and Xiao still haven't made up yet?

21:51.200 --> 21:52.510
Save that gossiping brain of yours

21:52.510 --> 21:54.770
for designing the new instance dungeon.

21:55.720 --> 21:56.200
Xiu.

21:56.300 --> 21:58.500
How about changing it from snow to rain?

21:58.550 --> 22:00.960
Snow is way prettier,

22:01.060 --> 22:03.310
and rain would leave the players
soaking wet.

22:03.310 --> 22:04.070
By the way,

22:04.070 --> 22:06.800
it was Xiao who suggested snow
in the first place.

22:06.870 --> 22:08.590
I thought it was too much trouble

22:08.590 --> 22:09.750
and kept opposing it,

22:09.750 --> 22:11.350
but he insisted.

22:12.310 --> 22:13.000
Sometimes,

22:13.000 --> 22:15.080
even when the game wasn't on,
he'd still come by,

22:15.080 --> 22:15.920
do nothing,

22:15.950 --> 22:16.950
and watch the snow

22:17.200 --> 22:18.510
for hours.

22:23.920 --> 22:25.600
It was snowing that day too.

22:34.880 --> 22:36.240
It was my fault for not being thorough.

22:36.240 --> 22:37.540
I got flustered that day—

22:37.540 --> 22:38.760
heard a whisper of news

22:38.760 --> 22:40.080
and rushed to tell you.

22:42.000 --> 22:43.900
Before Lyman terminated
their contract with us,

22:43.900 --> 22:46.590
they brought in a third-party auditor
to assist with the investigation.

22:46.590 --> 22:48.000
One of them is my friend,

22:48.220 --> 22:50.150
so I took him out for a private meal.

22:52.160 --> 22:53.330
They have strict rules.

22:53.330 --> 22:55.570
No matter how I tried,
he wouldn't spill anything.

22:55.570 --> 22:57.040
But he let something slip:

22:58.070 --> 22:59.330
the one who reported us

22:59.550 --> 23:00.720
wasn't a supplier,

23:01.010 --> 23:03.210
but someone who's completely

23:03.240 --> 23:05.440
mapped out our suppliers' operations.

23:07.400 --> 23:08.110
Mr. Pei,

23:08.880 --> 23:11.010
do you think Forma's supplier details

23:11.520 --> 23:13.130
might have been leaked?

23:16.650 --> 23:19.580
The one who knows everything
about our suppliers...

23:25.330 --> 23:26.480
Xiao Zhiyu?

23:47.900 --> 23:49.820
Don't repeat the same mistake!

24:05.880 --> 24:06.550
Dad.

24:08.180 --> 24:10.870
The starving dog
you kindly took in years ago

24:11.790 --> 24:13.110
has turned into

24:14.030 --> 24:16.160
an ungrateful wolf.

24:36.070 --> 24:36.680
Here.

24:41.840 --> 24:42.310
Dad.

24:42.480 --> 24:43.110
Mrs. Xiao.

24:44.590 --> 24:46.790
It's been a while
since we had breakfast together.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.030
My stomach's been acting up lately,

24:48.030 --> 24:49.960
so I can't skip breakfast anymore.

24:50.070 --> 24:51.480
A few days ago, Zhiyu mentioned

24:51.480 --> 24:54.080
that my premium medical insurance
is offshore

24:54.310 --> 24:55.920
and not very convenient in China,

24:55.920 --> 24:58.880
so he wants to arrange
another policy for me domestically.

24:58.880 --> 25:00.160
For that, I'll need to provide

25:00.160 --> 25:01.830
all my bank account details,

25:02.430 --> 25:04.190
proof of overseas assets,

25:04.350 --> 25:06.210
tax records, and stuff like that.

25:11.600 --> 25:12.610
You need this much paperwork

25:12.610 --> 25:14.010
for an insurance policy?

25:14.680 --> 25:17.140
They say it's to verify
my financial status.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.200
Kanghua,

25:18.590 --> 25:20.060
help me figure out

25:20.110 --> 25:22.240
how to get
proof of my investment returns.

25:22.240 --> 25:24.100
I'm not very clear on the process.

25:25.360 --> 25:27.750
I'll go collect the paperwork now

25:27.870 --> 25:29.130
before I forget again.

25:38.920 --> 25:40.160
Xiao Zhiyu is sneaking a look at

25:40.160 --> 25:41.590
Mrs. Xiao's accounts,

25:42.140 --> 25:44.870
trying to see if she's involved with
our company.

25:50.840 --> 25:53.920
[Outpatient]

25:55.790 --> 25:56.750
I'm finally

25:57.050 --> 25:58.450
seeing daylight again.

25:58.920 --> 26:00.070
The doctor just said

26:00.190 --> 26:03.030
that once you get home, you need to
behave and do your rehab properly.

26:03.030 --> 26:03.690
Otherwise,

26:03.750 --> 26:04.480
you'll have to come back.

26:04.480 --> 26:05.210
Understand?

26:05.300 --> 26:06.430
Mom, I'll get a taxi.

26:08.680 --> 26:09.540
Did you get one?

26:11.010 --> 26:12.070
The traffic's bad.

26:15.310 --> 26:16.570
Hello, Uncle, Auntie.

26:16.590 --> 26:17.830
My name is Gong Huaicong.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.270
I'm Ms. Zhao's business partner

26:19.270 --> 26:20.670
and also Hu Xiu's friend.

26:21.990 --> 26:23.650
What's with the extra effort?

26:23.750 --> 26:25.000
What do you mean extra effort?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.110
I'm just here to help out.

26:26.110 --> 26:27.720
I knew Uncle was being discharged today,

26:27.720 --> 26:28.830
so I came specially to pick you guys up,

26:28.830 --> 26:31.160
saving Hu Xiu the trouble of
hiring a taxi.

26:31.160 --> 26:32.150
-That's really...
-Thank you.

26:32.150 --> 26:33.410
Sorry for the trouble.

26:33.440 --> 26:34.880
Please don't mention it, Uncle.

26:34.880 --> 26:36.920
When I was organizing events
with Ms. Zhao before,

26:36.920 --> 26:39.160
Hu Xiu worked very hard
and didn't ask for a penny.

26:39.160 --> 26:39.480
So please,

26:39.480 --> 26:41.680
give me this chance to return the favor.

26:42.160 --> 26:42.690
Alright.

26:42.920 --> 26:43.740
Thank you then.

26:43.740 --> 26:44.500
My pleasure.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.110
Come on, Uncle. Get in the car.

26:46.110 --> 26:47.170
Alright, alright.

26:48.390 --> 26:48.920
Alright.

26:48.920 --> 26:49.600
Be careful.

26:53.000 --> 26:53.550
Is this okay?

26:53.550 --> 26:54.030
Yes.

26:54.440 --> 26:55.030
Let me.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.240
Watch your head.

26:56.440 --> 26:56.970
Alright.

26:57.400 --> 26:57.830
Watch your head.

26:57.830 --> 26:58.270
Okay.

26:58.270 --> 26:59.330
Alright, alright.

27:01.030 --> 27:01.960
Watch your hand.

27:04.290 --> 27:06.350
Everything's arranged so thoughtfully.

27:06.350 --> 27:09.480
He must've been sent here by Xiao Zhiyu,
don't you think?

27:15.480 --> 27:16.110
Uncle,

27:16.380 --> 27:17.900
feeling comfortable?

27:18.830 --> 27:19.760
Yeah, very nice.

27:21.350 --> 27:23.810
I've really caused you guys
a lot of trouble.

27:24.040 --> 27:26.030
During this time, due to my condition,

27:26.030 --> 27:27.890
Xiu has been working really hard,

27:27.960 --> 27:29.690
and it's affected Xiaorou too.

27:30.240 --> 27:31.270
Did the business of your café

27:31.270 --> 27:32.200
get affected?

27:32.430 --> 27:33.550
Uncle, I've got an assistant
watching over things.

27:33.550 --> 27:34.810
Nothing was affected.

27:35.550 --> 27:36.920
Uncle, don't worry.

27:37.110 --> 27:37.880
The caregiver

27:37.880 --> 27:38.790
is hired long-term.

27:38.790 --> 27:40.880
He'll stay until you recover.
Very professional.

27:40.880 --> 27:41.770
And with this car at your disposal,

27:41.770 --> 27:43.430
you can get around whenever you need.

27:43.430 --> 27:44.300
This way,

27:44.320 --> 27:45.830
Auntie won't have to exhaust herself,

27:45.830 --> 27:47.000
Ms. Zhao won't need to
keep running back and forth,

27:47.000 --> 27:49.010
and Hu Xiu can go to work
with peace of mind.

27:49.010 --> 27:49.820
Right, Hu Xiu?

27:55.880 --> 27:56.720
You look tired.

27:56.720 --> 27:57.650
Have some water.

27:58.070 --> 27:58.750
I'm not tired.

27:58.750 --> 27:59.830
I haven't done much work.

27:59.830 --> 28:02.290
I meant you look tired
from all that talking.

28:24.080 --> 28:24.560
Here.

28:24.680 --> 28:25.240
Alright.

28:31.310 --> 28:32.910
Thank you so much for your help today.

28:32.910 --> 28:33.960
Come upstairs for a rest, will you?

28:33.960 --> 28:35.310
No thanks, Auntie. I don't want to impose.

28:35.310 --> 28:36.240
I'm heading back to the shop.

28:36.240 --> 28:37.680
Please, go upstairs and get some rest.

28:37.680 --> 28:38.880
Go back and get some rest as well.

28:38.880 --> 28:40.680
The caregiver and I
can take things from here.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.280
Call me if you need anything.

28:42.480 --> 28:43.990
Uncle, Auntie, we'll be going now.

28:43.990 --> 28:45.470
Alright. Take care.

28:45.650 --> 28:46.980
Once he's doing better,

28:46.990 --> 28:48.240
come over for a meal, alright?

28:48.240 --> 28:48.900
Certainly.

28:49.550 --> 28:50.420
Please, go on upstairs.

28:50.420 --> 28:51.310
Goodbye, Uncle.

28:51.310 --> 28:52.200
Alright, take care.

28:52.200 --> 28:52.730
Bye-bye.

28:52.750 --> 28:53.260
Bye-bye.

28:53.260 --> 28:54.260
Goodbye, Auntie.

28:56.970 --> 28:58.170
Everything alright?

29:00.350 --> 29:02.170
What happened in the car just now?

29:02.170 --> 29:03.630
Did I say something wrong?

29:04.110 --> 29:05.070
Don't tell me

29:06.070 --> 29:07.160
that Hu Xiu's father

29:07.160 --> 29:09.750
doesn't want her to
work at the studio anymore,

29:09.750 --> 29:12.550
just because of what happened
with Xiao's father.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.120
Let's talk on the way.

29:18.440 --> 29:18.960
Li,

29:19.000 --> 29:19.790
come and take a look.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.920
The kitchen is here.

29:21.960 --> 29:22.240
The kitchen.

29:22.240 --> 29:22.590
Okay. Got it.

29:22.590 --> 29:23.350
And this medicine kit

29:23.350 --> 29:25.110
contains all our daily medications.

29:25.110 --> 29:25.680
Everything's in here.

29:25.680 --> 29:26.160
Okay.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.540
And here is the bathroom.

29:27.540 --> 29:28.540
Come take a look.

29:30.270 --> 29:31.920
This is the master bedroom.

29:32.270 --> 29:32.790
Alright.

29:32.790 --> 29:34.550
And this is Xiu's room.

29:34.550 --> 29:35.550
Okay, I got it.

29:35.920 --> 29:36.160
Alright.

29:36.160 --> 29:36.640
Xiu.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.400
How are things arranged

29:38.400 --> 29:39.510
with your work?

29:46.310 --> 29:46.790
Xiu?

29:46.790 --> 29:47.640
Hu.

29:49.990 --> 29:51.920
She can't just walk out like that.

29:51.960 --> 29:53.990
The handover will take at least a month.

29:53.990 --> 29:55.390
I mean... I want you to...

30:02.110 --> 30:02.830
Xiu.

30:04.670 --> 30:05.940
As for your work arrangements,

30:05.940 --> 30:07.100
there's no rush.

30:09.030 --> 30:10.240
We need to

30:10.590 --> 30:12.250
see things through properly.

30:12.590 --> 30:13.920
I'll give you time

30:14.270 --> 30:15.870
to sort things out properly.

30:29.950 --> 30:31.800
No wonder Xiao told me

30:32.170 --> 30:33.480
not to bring him up
in front of Hu Xiu's parents

30:33.480 --> 30:36.730
or tell them he was the one who arranged
the car and the caregiver.

30:36.730 --> 30:38.210
Because only this way

30:38.550 --> 30:39.750
could Xiu's parents

30:39.750 --> 30:42.280
accept his kindness
without feeling uneasy.

30:43.000 --> 30:45.000
The problem between him and Hu Xiu

30:45.480 --> 30:47.080
is just impossible to solve.

30:47.720 --> 30:49.480
My Poor Xiu.

30:49.820 --> 30:51.900
She finally found happiness,

30:52.270 --> 30:54.350
but it has to be
like sugar coated with shards of glass.

30:54.350 --> 30:55.880
Xiao is pitiful too.

30:56.030 --> 30:59.490
The person he's determined to love
is the very person he can't.

30:59.600 --> 31:01.000
How painful that must be.

31:04.830 --> 31:06.500
Mom, I'm home.

31:07.510 --> 31:09.310
You guys get some rest early too.

32:10.600 --> 32:11.860
There's an emergency.

32:27.440 --> 32:28.240
Hu Xiu?

32:29.200 --> 32:30.960
Aren't you still on leave today?

32:30.960 --> 32:32.240
I came to talk to Mr. Xiao
about something.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.030
Is he here?

32:33.510 --> 32:34.770
He just went upstairs.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.120
Xiao Zhiyu.

32:45.900 --> 32:46.830
Why are you here?

32:49.000 --> 32:50.970
Thank you for taking care of
the arrangements

32:50.970 --> 32:52.430
after my dad's discharge.

32:54.350 --> 32:55.750
It's the least I could do.

32:56.520 --> 32:58.120
If he hadn't seen the news online,

32:58.120 --> 33:00.580
he wouldn't have gone out
that late at night.

33:00.880 --> 33:02.610
I came to talk to you about this.

33:04.270 --> 33:06.400
Pei Zhen came to see me at the hospital.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.550
I think it was him

33:07.550 --> 33:09.000
who released the news.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.530
And these documents

33:13.320 --> 33:15.780
were likely sent to my parents
by him as well.

33:27.100 --> 33:29.070
[Xincheng Stadium Under Construction
Collapses]

33:27.100 --> 33:29.070
[Killing 3 and Injuring 6;
Lead Architect Takes Own Life]

33:28.780 --> 33:29.930
Besides Pei Kanghua,

33:29.930 --> 33:31.390
keep an eye on Pei Zhen too.

33:32.150 --> 33:34.150
Who knows what his next move will be.

33:37.550 --> 33:38.310
Mr. Xiao.

33:41.550 --> 33:43.200
Investigators from
the Market Supervision Bureau are here.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.550
They're right downstairs.

33:44.550 --> 33:45.550
What happened?

33:46.440 --> 33:48.920
Forma's supplier information
has been leaked online.

33:48.920 --> 33:51.490
It involves the leak of
many confidential internal quotes

33:51.490 --> 33:53.510
with our studio's watermark on them.

33:53.510 --> 33:55.830
Forma, along with the suppliers,
lodged a complaint against us.

33:55.830 --> 33:59.430
There's no way that information
could have leaked from our side.

34:12.670 --> 34:14.469
Thank you for your cooperation.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.520
Mr. Xiao, right?

34:21.120 --> 34:21.699
Ms. Zhou.

34:23.060 --> 34:23.830
This time,

34:23.850 --> 34:25.920
all employees who have handled
Forma's supplier list

34:25.920 --> 34:27.480
must cooperate with the investigation.

34:27.480 --> 34:28.280
I understand.

34:28.440 --> 34:30.590
I was the one
who handled the Forma project.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.710
My work computer
has been at the office the whole time.

34:31.710 --> 34:32.469
It hasn't been touched.

34:32.469 --> 34:33.199
Understood.

34:33.230 --> 34:33.920
During the investigation,

34:33.920 --> 34:36.920
we'll keep this computer in our custody
temporarily.

34:37.070 --> 34:37.400
Mr. Xiao,

34:37.400 --> 34:39.600
you'll need to come with us separately.

34:41.000 --> 34:42.710
Besides the complaint about

34:43.030 --> 34:45.070
supplier information leakage,

34:45.230 --> 34:46.960
Mr. Xiao, you're also suspected of
privately investigating

34:46.960 --> 34:48.000
supplier data

34:48.110 --> 34:49.909
and other infringement issues.

34:49.949 --> 34:51.949
So you'll need to cooperate with us.

34:53.150 --> 34:53.880
Mr. Xiao.

34:55.260 --> 34:56.010
No problem.

35:33.360 --> 35:35.230
The innocent have nothing to fear.

35:35.230 --> 35:36.790
Go home

35:36.840 --> 35:38.400
once the investigators leave.

35:38.400 --> 35:40.130
I'll inform you of any updates.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.840
How did this even happen?

35:49.030 --> 35:50.070
It just got out.

35:50.740 --> 35:54.070
If they slap a
leak-of-confidential-info charge on him...

35:55.880 --> 35:57.400
Like father, like son.

35:57.870 --> 36:01.200
People out there will definitely
make a big deal out of this.

36:02.640 --> 36:04.900
Both he and our studio will be in trouble.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.070
I see.

36:18.110 --> 36:19.110
Why are you here?

36:19.410 --> 36:21.010
You're not welcome here now.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.290
Are you out of your mind?

36:26.360 --> 36:28.160
You could've just come after me.

36:28.450 --> 36:30.320
But instead, you caused
her father's accident

36:30.320 --> 36:31.230
and got her suspected of leaking info.

36:31.230 --> 36:33.200
Is that your idea of protecting her?

36:33.200 --> 36:35.330
I didn't cause her father's accident.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.480
You were right.

36:38.470 --> 36:40.110
Everything I've done...

36:40.670 --> 36:41.800
Is because of you!

36:45.140 --> 36:46.620
If you hadn't shown up,

36:47.960 --> 36:50.290
she wouldn't have been dragged into this.

36:50.590 --> 36:52.520
I never expected that, Xiao Zhiyu,

36:53.280 --> 36:54.630
after all these years,

36:54.910 --> 36:56.910
the first time I see you lose control

36:58.590 --> 37:00.550
would be over a woman.

37:03.110 --> 37:03.760
No.

37:04.800 --> 37:06.150
It's to teach you

37:07.230 --> 37:09.360
that there are lines you cannot cross.

37:09.760 --> 37:12.020
Cross them, and I won't spare you either.

37:13.320 --> 37:14.400
You? Teach me?

37:14.550 --> 37:15.630
On what grounds!

37:18.960 --> 37:21.210
Your miserable past?

37:25.960 --> 37:26.800
Xiao Zhiyu,

37:27.710 --> 37:28.770
listen carefully.

37:29.840 --> 37:31.590
I've never done you wrong.

37:32.250 --> 37:33.770
You're the one who owes me!

37:39.360 --> 37:41.620
From the moment you came into our family,

37:42.710 --> 37:44.440
my life was completely ruined.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.280
As long as you're around,

37:48.480 --> 37:50.110
no one ever sees me.

37:53.150 --> 37:54.710
No matter how hard I try,

37:55.630 --> 37:58.090
I'll never measure up to you
in others' eyes.

38:05.190 --> 38:06.880
Even Hu Xiu is the same.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.710
She knows exactly who you are

38:12.030 --> 38:13.760
and still takes your side.

38:15.620 --> 38:16.950
Why?

38:29.740 --> 38:32.740
You should've spent your life
keeping your head down.

38:34.480 --> 38:37.610
You wouldn't be who you are today
without the Pei family.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.110
And what did you do?

38:40.280 --> 38:42.280
You repaid kindness with betrayal.

38:42.380 --> 38:43.910
You sold out the Pei family.

38:44.700 --> 38:46.560
The one who's been crossing lines

38:48.030 --> 38:49.670
has always been you.

38:53.760 --> 38:54.760
Look at yourself,

38:55.670 --> 38:57.280
shamelessly flipping the truth
on its head.

38:57.280 --> 38:59.280
You really do look like Pei Kanghua.

39:03.160 --> 39:04.480
How did I ever forget

39:06.360 --> 39:07.760
that you and him

39:09.480 --> 39:11.250
share the same blood?

39:13.840 --> 39:14.670
Zhiyu!

39:21.840 --> 39:23.840
Is what he said true?

39:23.920 --> 39:25.580
Was it you who reported Forma?

39:30.550 --> 39:32.590
You asked for my bank account information

39:32.590 --> 39:35.150
just to take revenge on
Kanghua and Forma?

39:39.280 --> 39:40.190
Zhiyu.

39:40.960 --> 39:42.280
It's been 20 years.

39:44.840 --> 39:45.590
I thought

39:46.000 --> 39:48.060
you just didn't want to be close to us,

39:48.360 --> 39:49.480
but I never imagined

39:49.480 --> 39:52.410
you've been harboring
this kind of hatred all along.

39:52.590 --> 39:54.880
You don't have to accept the decision
I made back then,

39:54.880 --> 39:57.880
and you can even condemn me
for being weak and cowardly.

39:57.880 --> 39:58.550
But do you

39:59.320 --> 40:00.520
really have to make me

40:00.760 --> 40:02.360
lose my family all over again

40:02.710 --> 40:04.320
before you're satisfied?

40:16.800 --> 40:17.480
Mom.

40:20.590 --> 40:22.450
The "family" you just mentioned—

40:26.440 --> 40:27.590
did that include me?
